    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tall Man Tapes<strong>\u00a0</strong>is a found footage-inspired horror experience. As a solitary investigator drawn to reports of UFO activity and supernatural occurrences, you'll venture into the unknown with nothing but your camera. Explore sinister and abandoned locations where each disturbing discovery and unexplained sound brings you closer to either revelation\u2014or a fate worse than death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECRETS ON SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/e5538a623e06fa5a1f0f4a836f1f84c7.poster.avif?t=1734723084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/e5538a623e06fa5a1f0f4a836f1f84c7.webm?t=1734723084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/e5538a623e06fa5a1f0f4a836f1f84c7.mp4?t=1734723084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and investigate secret tapes and documents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE ANOMALOUS PHENOMENA </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/6f191ce769ffd9d5d68269aaaaac0b56.poster.avif?t=1734723084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/6f191ce769ffd9d5d68269aaaaac0b56.webm?t=1734723084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/6f191ce769ffd9d5d68269aaaaac0b56.mp4?t=1734723084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery exists around every corner. Document the unexplainable.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tall Man Tapes<strong>\u00a0</strong>is a found footage-inspired horror experience. As a solitary investigator drawn to reports of UFO activity and supernatural occurrences, you'll venture into the unknown with nothing but your camera. Explore sinister and abandoned locations where each disturbing discovery and unexplained sound brings you closer to either revelation\u2014or a fate worse than death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECRETS ON SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/e5538a623e06fa5a1f0f4a836f1f84c7.poster.avif?t=1734723084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/e5538a623e06fa5a1f0f4a836f1f84c7.webm?t=1734723084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/e5538a623e06fa5a1f0f4a836f1f84c7.mp4?t=1734723084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and investigate secret tapes and documents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE ANOMALOUS PHENOMENA </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/6f191ce769ffd9d5d68269aaaaac0b56.poster.avif?t=1734723084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/6f191ce769ffd9d5d68269aaaaac0b56.webm?t=1734723084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369940/extras/6f191ce769ffd9d5d68269aaaaac0b56.mp4?t=1734723084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery exists around every corner. Document the unexplainable.</p>",
